### 35. Memory Trick

Remember:

```text
METHOD CALLS
     ↓
STACK FRAMES
     ↓
STACK BECOMES FULL
     ↓
STACK OVERFLOW
     ↓
StackOverflowError
```

And remember the easiest sentence:

> **"Method calls itself → stack keeps growing → stack becomes full → StackOverflowError."**

For recursion:

> **"Recursion needs a stopping condition."**

